abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the paper "A deep learning climate emulator encodes the
  typicality of extreme heatwaves in its latent space". Analyses are
  conditioned on the Paris box (1.25-3.75°E, 49-50°N) in JJA on the HEALPix
  nside-64 grid of the DLESyM coupled atmosphere-ocean emulator, covering
  physical heatwave diagnostics and analysis of DLESyM latent
  representations.
